
flowchart LR

%% youtube summarization pipeline 


    Client[Client]

    Client -->|POST /summarize| API[YouTube Summarizer API]

    API -->|Generate Task ID| Couch[(CouchDB)]

    API -->|Create Task Document| Couch

    API -->|Push task_id| MasterQueue[(Master Redis Queue)]

    API -->|202 Accepted + task_id| Client

    MasterQueue --> MasterWorker[Master Worker]

    MasterWorker --> Workflow[Workflow Orchestrator]

    Workflow -->|Submit Video Job| VideoService[Video Processing Service]

    EventStream[(Redis Stream)]

    VideoService -->|video.completed + result| EventStream
    OCRService[OCR Service] -->|ocr.completed + result| EventStream
    VisionService[Vision Service] -->|vision.completed + result| EventStream
    WhisperService[Whisper Service] -->|whisper.completed + result| EventStream

    EventStream --> Workflow

    Workflow -->|Update CouchDB| Couch

    Workflow --> Decision{All Services Completed?}

    Decision -->|No| Wait[Wait For Next Event]

    Decision -->|Yes| SummaryQueue[(Summary Redis Queue)]

    SummaryQueue --> SummaryWorker[Summary Worker]

    SummaryWorker -->|Read Task| Couch

    SummaryWorker --> LLM[LLM]

    LLM -->|Update Summary| Couch

    SummaryWorker --> Notification[Notification Service]

    Client -->|GET /tasks/:task_id| API

    API --> Couch

%% master worker lld 


    Queue[(Master Redis Queue)]

    Queue --> Worker[Master Worker]

    Worker --> Read[Read Task Document]

    Read --> Start[Start Workflow]

    Start --> Workflow[Workflow Orchestrator]


%% work flow orchestrator lld 


    Event[Receive Redis Stream Event]

    Event --> Update[Update CouchDB Result]

    Update --> Stage{Workflow Stage}

    Stage -->|Task Created| Video[Submit Video Processing]

    Video --> End1[Done]

    Stage -->|video.completed| Parallel[Submit OCR Vision Whisper]

    Parallel --> End2[Done]

    Stage -->|ocr/vision/whisper.completed| Check{All Parallel Jobs Complete?}

    Check -->|No| End3[Wait]

    Check -->|Yes| Summary[Push task_id to Summary Queue]

    Summary --> End4[Done]


%% ocr service 



    Request --> API

    API --> Queue[(Redis Queue)]

    Queue --> Worker

    Worker --> OCR[OCR Engine]

    OCR --> Event[Publish ocr.completed]

    Event --> Stream[(Redis Stream)]



%% vision service


    Request --> API

    API --> Queue[(Redis Queue)]

    Queue --> Worker

    Worker --> Batch[Create Image Batches]

    Batch --> OpenRouter[OpenRouter]

    OpenRouter --> Merge[Merge Responses]

    Merge --> Event[Publish vision.completed]

    Event --> Stream[(Redis Stream)]


%% whisper service


    Request --> API

    API --> Queue[(Redis Queue)]

    Queue --> Worker

    Worker --> Whisper[Speech To Text]

    Whisper --> Event[Publish whisper.completed]

    Event --> Stream[(Redis Stream)]



%% Video Processing



    Request --> API

    API --> Queue[(Redis Queue)]

    Queue --> Worker

    Worker --> Download[Download Video]

    Download --> Scene[Scene Detection]

    Scene --> Frames[Extract Frames]

    Frames --> Audio[Extract Audio]

    Audio --> Metadata[Generate Metadata]

    Metadata --> Event[Publish video.completed]

    Event --> Stream[(Redis Stream)]


%% summary worker lld



    Queue[(Summary Redis Queue)]

    Queue --> Worker[Summary Worker]

    Worker --> Read[Read CouchDB]

    Read --> Prompt[Build Prompt]

    Prompt --> LLM[Generate Summary]

    LLM --> Update[Update CouchDB]

    Update --> Notify[summary.completed]

    Notify --> Notification[Notification Service]


%% event flow lld

sequenceDiagram

    participant Client
    participant API
    participant CouchDB
    participant MW as Master Worker
    participant WO as Workflow Orchestrator
    participant VP as Video Processing
    participant OCR
    participant Vision
    participant Whisper
    participant Stream as Redis Stream
    participant SW as Summary Worker

    Client->>API: POST /summarize

    API->>CouchDB: Create Task

    API->>MW: Push task_id

    MW->>WO: Start Workflow

    WO->>VP: Submit Video

    VP->>Stream: video.completed + result

    Stream->>WO: Event

    WO->>CouchDB: Update Video Result

    WO->>OCR: Submit OCR

    WO->>Vision: Submit Vision

    WO->>Whisper: Submit Whisper

    OCR->>Stream: ocr.completed + result

    Vision->>Stream: vision.completed + result

    Whisper->>Stream: whisper.completed + result

    Stream->>WO: Events (Sequential)

    WO->>CouchDB: Update Results

    WO->>SW: Push Summary Job

    SW->>CouchDB: Read Task

    SW->>SW: Generate Summary

    SW->>CouchDB: Store Summary


